      It reads as `auto_merge.grant = "dispatch"` for one release.
      Migrate: fno config set auto_merge.grant dispatch && fno config unset dispatch.auto_merge
warn: <FIXTURE>/project/.fno/config.toml sets the deprecated `dispatch.harness`.
      It reads as the fallback harness rung for one release, below the stage table.
      Migrate: fno config set agents.profiles.target.provider codex --local && fno config unset dispatch.harness --local
warn: <FIXTURE>/project/.fno/config.toml sets `active_backlog.mission`, which the mission-scoped drain IGNORES (missions are per-epic graph state, not config).
      Live axis: `fno backlog advance --epic <id>` activates a mission; `--stop` retires it.
      Remove the ignored key: fno config unset active_backlog.mission --local
